Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 16:55:56 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 49/53] dt-bindings: PCI: starfive: describe endpoint supply

The JH7110 host driver already obtains and controls a vpcie3v3 regulator,
and existing board descriptions provide it. Document the supply so those
descriptions satisfy the controller schema.

Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-5
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/pci/starfive,jh7110-pcie.yaml          | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pci/starfive,jh7110-pcie.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pci/starfive,jh7110-pcie.yaml
index 33c80626e8ec9..fd829dc422c6a 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pci/starfive,jh7110-pcie.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pci/starfive,jh7110-pcie.yaml
@@ -68,6 +68,9 @@ properties:
       Specified PHY is attached to PCIe controller.
     maxItems: 1
 
+  vpcie3v3-supply:
+    description: 3.3 V supply for the PCIe endpoint.
+
 required:
   - clocks
   - resets
